{
  "case_id": "A-025",
  "category": "bottleneck_matching",
  "description": [
    "Bottleneck bipartite matching: Pad rectangular matrices and binary-search finite costs for ",
    "the lowest threshold admitting a perfect matching; use Hopcroft-Karp to test each ",
    "threshold. If no perfect matching is found and finite costs exist, use a matching at the ",
    "highest threshold; this fallback need not minimize the bottleneck of an incomplete ",
    "matching. Trim padded assignments."
